{"state":"okay","message":"정상적으로 데이터를 가져왔습니다.","payload":[{"WordDictionary":"<div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">IPS</p></div><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\">IPS(In Plane Switching)</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\">IPS 패널은&nbsp;수평 배향성 액정을 사용하는 방식이다. 액정이 전극 사이에 일정한 간격으로 수평 배열되어 있어, 시야각이 좋은것이 특징입니다. 또한 액정 분자가 수직으로 서지 않기 때문에 화면을 터치해도 복원력이 뛰어나고, 비교적 정확하게 색감을 표현해 준다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img.danawa.com/prod_img/term/group_7/3871/20200818165721353_4DWMF43Q.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 238px; max-width: 100%; width: 300px; line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\">&lt;출처 - LG 전자 공식 블로그&gt;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\"><br style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\"><br style=\"font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\">Nano&nbsp;IPS</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">&nbsp;Nano IPS&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">패널은</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\"></span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: LGSmHa, sans-serif; color: rgb(59, 60, 62); line-height: 20px !important;\">LCD 표면에 약 1나노미터(nm)의 나노 입자를 입혀 색 정확도와 색 재현력을 끌어올리는 방식이다.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">나노</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">입자는</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">&nbsp;580~610&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">나노미터</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">파장의</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">빛을</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">잘</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">흡수해</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">색의</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">순도를</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">높임으로써</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">색상을</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">정확하게</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">구현하기</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\">때문에 기존 IPS의 특징인 넓은 시야각을 유지하면서도 더 높은 색 재현율을 구현하고&nbsp;게이밍용으로는 다소 아쉬웠던 응답속도를 끌어올렸다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img.danawa.com/prod_img/term/group_7/3871/20200818171216544_6A6KLPUY.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 20px !important; height: auto !important;\"></p><div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">VA</p></div><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">VA(Vertical Alignment)는&nbsp;IPS나 PLS와 같이&nbsp;광시야각 패널 중 하나로&nbsp;PVA, S-PVA, MVA, A-MVA, A-MVA+ 등이 있습니다.</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">VA 패널의 특징은 응답속도가 IPS 패널에 비해 조금 느리지만 명암비(밝고 어두움을 표현해 주는 정도)와 색 재현율이 좋다는 장점이 있습니다.<br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/4/3920_1_1398833109.jpg\" width=\"390\" height=\"186\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 20px !important; height: auto !important; text-align: center !important;\"></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br></p><div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">TN(일반)</p></div><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">TN이란 Twisted Nematic의 약자로써 LCD 패널 중 가장 빠른 반응속도를 갖고 있다는 것이 특징입니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">하지만 시야각은 넓지 않아서 광시야각이 아닌 일반 패널로 불리우며, 24bit 색상(1670만 색상)을 재생하지 못한다는 단점이 있습니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">그러나 반응속도가 최고 2ms 까지 나오고 가격이 저렴하기 때문에 PC방이나 보급형 LCD 모니터를 찾는 사람들에게는 적당한 패널입니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><img id=\"image_03430271836295371\" class=\"chimg_photo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/4/3921_1_1354236836.JPG\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 154px; max-width: 100%; width: 390px; line-height: 20px !important;\"></p></div><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"><tn 수=\"\" 있습니다=\"\" 패널은=\"\" 단점이=\"\" 못하다는=\"\" 넓지=\"\" 시야각은=\"\" 저렴하지만=\"\" 가격이=\"\" 있으며=\"\" 낼=\"\" 응답속도를=\"\" 빠른=\"\" 가장=\"\" 중에서=\"\" 패널들=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"></tn><br style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br></p><div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">PLS</p></div><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">PLS란 'Plane Line Switching'의 약자로, IPS, VA와 같은 광시야각 패널의 한 종류입니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">PLS패널은&nbsp;삼성에서 생산하는 VA패널을 대체하기 위해 개발되었으며, VA의&nbsp;장점은 더욱 발전시키고 단점은 개선한 새로운 패널입니다. 색재현율, 휘도, 명암비 등을 개선되어 더욱 선명하고 소비전력은 낮아진 반면에 VA 패널의 단점이었던 응답속도도 개선이 되었습니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">시야각은 기존과 같은 178도 광시야각으로써 상하/좌우로 넓은 시야각을 보장하고 있습니다.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br></p><div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">AHVA</p></div><p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">AHVA (Advanced Hyper-Viewing Angle) 패널은 AUO사에서 개발한 광시야각 패널로 IPS 계열과 유사하여 IPS 타입의 패널로 구분합니다. VA 패널의 단점이였던 응답속도를 높이고 시야각에 따른 색반전을 획기적으로 감소시켰습니다. 패널명에 'VA'라는 문구로 인해 VA 패널이라고 오해하지 않으시길 바랍니다.</p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; text-align: left; line-height: 20px !important;\"></div><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.2px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img id=\"image_029694377131685545\" class=\"chimg_photo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/27/26175_1_1465973909.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important; height: 267px; max-width: 100%; text-align: center !important; width: 390px;\"></p></div>"}]}